Agreed, in theory there is little to be said about search.  I am basing my assessment on empirical results on a number of test problems.  I'm not sure which paper I'm remembering, but poking around turned up http://www.ece.northwestern.edu/~nocedal/PDFfiles/limited-memory.pdf (see table 4 on page 8).  I wish I could find the 1988 tech report they reference, as it seems likely to have more results.

Ben, thanks for posting a list of the problems having issues with optimization.  I'll take a look and see what's happening with them.

Cheers,
Marcus

