They're in prob/transform.hpp and should be broken
out into individual files, one per transform function.

I don't think they'd be that hard to add if we had
a way to pass in the lp__ variable from the modeling
language.

An orthogonal high-priority to-do item is to write
custom derivatives for the transforms.  And to
vectorize them.

- Bob

