> >>    It hasn't come up as an issue except where someone literally
> >>    wrote sqrt(square(x)) in code as an example and in sd().
> >>
> >>
> >>        Putting those two things together, maybe
> >>        we can just rewrite chain for sqrt() to be:
> >>
> >>                  void chain() {
> >>                    if (val_ > 1e-300)
> >>                        avi_->adj_ += adj_ / (2.0 * val_);
> >>                    else
> >>                        avi_->adj_ += adj_ / 2.0;
> >>                  }
> >>
> >>        or, alternatively,
