From u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com  Sat Nov 30 01:19:47 2013
From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Sat, 30 Nov 2013 01:19:47 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Re: Stability of our code base, new vs. existing features
Message-ID: <i8nTR4Cffbg.iJ0qdrbat7wJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
